<div class="text-center">
    <h1 class="display-4">Welcome to LaundryGo</h1>
    <p>
        LaundryGo is a mobile application designed to enhance accessibility, efficiency, and transparency in laundry services. It addresses common challenges such as limited access to nearby shops, lack of real-time updates, and unclear pricing by providing a centralized platform.

        With LaundryGo, users can locate nearby laundry shops, view real-time availability, compare prices, and explore specialized services—all through an intuitive interface. This streamlines the decision-making process, saving time and ensuring convenience.

        By modernizing traditional laundry services, LaundryGo empowers users to make informed choices quickly and efficiently, transforming how laundry tasks are managed in Bacolod City.
    </p>
</div>
